# "If Mox Diamond would enter, you may discard a land card instead. If you do,
# put it onto the battlefield." The permanent spell resolves, its entry is
# replaced by the PayBeforeETB chain: the human picks the Forest to discard
# (Optional$ lets the pick be empty), and the chain's ChangeZone puts Mox
# Diamond onto the battlefield.
startturn human
advance 3
queue cardchoice 2
castspell human 1
resolvestack
